[EXAMPLES]
Convert all records to CSV:

  rec2csv contacts.rec

Convert only a specific record type:

  rec2csv -t Task todo.rec

Sort the output by a field:

  rec2csv -S Name contacts.rec

[SEE ALSO]
.BR csv2rec (1),
.BR json2rec (1),
.BR xml2rec (1),
.BR rec2json (1),
